abstract: >
  WAVEGUISE is a Python package initially developed for the analysis of atmospheric gravity waves in data sets of up to three dimensions. The algorithm separates a wavefield into a set of interpretable wave packets.

keywords:
  - atmospheric gravity waves
  - wavelet analysis
